  "description": "Wire QuerySpec into Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection with a fluent AddQuerySpec(...) builder. Opt in to auditing, security (data masking, encryption, row-level security), caching (in-memory or Redis via StackExchange.Redis), resilience (retry, circuit breaker, rate limiting), monitoring, and plugins — register only what you need, in one place. Start here for ASP.NET Core or any Generic Host app. Multi-targets .NET 8 (LTS), .NET 9, and .NET 10 (LTS).",
